    "10x Summon Results": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10x Beschwörungs-Ergebnisse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "10x Summon · %lld Gems": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "10x Beschwörung · %lld Edelsteine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 extra Endless Trial attempts — better value for a serious climb.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 zusätzliche Turm-Versuche — besseres Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis für einen ernsthaften Aufstieg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "20 Gems": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "20 Edelsteine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 extra Endless Trial attempts, on top of your free daily tickets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 zusätzliche Turm-Versuche, zusätzlich zu deinen kostenlosen täglichen Tickets."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "80 Gems": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "80 Edelsteine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bite that still carries the heat of falling through the sky.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Biss, der noch die Hitze des Falls durch den Himmel trägt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blazing leap that scorches the target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein lodernder Sprung, der das Ziel versengt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blazing rebirth that mends every wound in the team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine lodernde Wiedergeburt, die jede Wunde im Team heilt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blinding dash that leaves a trail of light.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein blendender Sprint, der eine Lichtspur hinterlässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clumsy but eager charge wreathed in flickering flame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein tollpatschiger, aber eifriger Ansturm, gehüllt in flackernde Flammen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coat so black it swallows the eclipse's faint light entirely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Fell so schwarz, dass es das schwache Licht der Finsternis völlig verschluckt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cold ember of moonlight that flickers whenever it's watched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine kalte Glut aus Mondlicht, die flackert, sobald man sie beobachtet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A colossal magical jungle of root tunnels and glowing, oversized flora.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein gewaltiger magischer Dschungel aus Wurzeltunneln und leuchtender, überdimensionaler Flora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cozy fantasy RPG for a few quiet minutes at a time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein gemütliches Fantasy-RPG für ein paar ruhige Minuten zwischendurch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dark wood lit only by luminous, dreaming flora.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein dunkler Wald, nur erhellt von leuchtender, träumender Flora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A darker echo of the Moonlit Forest, where old nightmares have grown teeth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein dunkleres Echo des Mondlichtwaldes, in dem alte Albträume Zähne bekommen haben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dignified, unhurried charge.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein würdevoller, gemächlicher Ansturm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast snap before the foe can react.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schneller Biss, bevor der Gegner reagieren kann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fast, low rake across the legs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schneller, tiefer Hieb über die Beine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flame that refuses to be the last one out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Flamme, die sich weigert, als letzte zu erlöschen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flowering tail that opens only when it senses a threat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein blühender Schwanz, der sich nur bei Bedrohung öffnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A friendly spark that lifts the spirit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein freundlicher Funke, der die Stimmung hebt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle pulse of moonlight for the ally who needs it most.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein sanfter Mondlichtimpuls für den Verbündeten, der ihn am meisten braucht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle push in the right direction.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein sanfter Schubs in die richtige Richtung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ground-shaking blow that staggers the foe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein bodenerschütternder Schlag, der den Gegner taumeln lässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A guaranteed Legendary reward for reaching this floor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine garantierte legendäre Belohnung für das Erreichen dieser Stufe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heavy but unhurried blow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schwerer, aber bedächtiger Schlag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heavy lash from somewhere just out of sight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schwerer Schlag aus dem toten Winkel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A jabbing strike aimed at the weak points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein stechender Angriff auf die Schwachstellen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A land locked in permanent eclipse beneath a vast, watching moon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Land in dauerhafter Finsternis unter einem riesigen, wachenden Mond."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A last echo of the dream this ruined city used to be.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein letztes Echo des Traums, der diese Ruinenstadt einst war."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A living crystal grown around a dream too heavy to wake from, shielded on every side.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein lebender Kristall, gewachsen um einen Traum, zu schwer, um daraus zu erwachen, von allen Seiten geschützt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A loose knot of drifting pollen and static, harmless until it swarms.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein loses Knäuel aus treibendem Pollen und Statik, harmlos, bis es schwärmt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Dreamkeeper joins you!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein neuer Dreamkeeper schließt sich dir an!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A playful nip that's hotter than it looks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein verspielter Biss, der heißer ist, als er aussieht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A precise strike from above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein präziser Angriff von oben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A precise strike laced with dream-thorn poison.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein präziser Stich, durchsetzt mit Traumdorn-Gift."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick flick of a glowing tail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schnelles Schwenken eines leuchtenden Schwanzes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick sidestep into darkness and back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schneller Schritt in die Dunkelheit und zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick, fussy grooming pass over an ally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schnelles, akribisches Pflegen eines Verbündeten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick, scorching nip at the nearest foe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schneller, versengender Biss gegen den nächsten Gegner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet shimmer that deflects the worst of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein stilles Schimmern, das das Schlimmste abwehrt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet, steadying presence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine stille, stabilisierende Präsenz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet, sunlit field where the first dreams take root.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein ruhiges, sonnendurchflutetes Feld, in dem die ersten Träume Wurzeln schlagen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A resonant howl that freezes the enemy in place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein hallendes Heulen, das den Gegner erstarren lässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ridged spine that glows brighter the angrier it gets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein gezackter Rücken, der heller glüht, je wütender es wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rolling wave of encouragement washes over the team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine rollende Welle der Ermutigung erfasst das Team."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A root older than the forest itself, slumbering beneath Eternal Bloom since before memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Wurzel, älter als der Wald selbst, schlummert seit undenklichen Zeiten unter Eternal Bloom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rush of small fish that steadies the whole team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Schwarm kleiner Fische, der das ganze Team stabilisiert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A scrap of night that broke off before the dream was finished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Fetzen Nacht, der sich löste, bevor der Traum zu Ende war."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A screaming dive trailing a burst of starlight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein schreiender Sturzflug, der eine Spur aus Sternenlicht hinterlässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A seedling dream that decided to grow claws instead of leaves.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Traum-Sprössling, der beschloss, Krallen statt Blätter zu wachsen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shard of an old star given teeth, prowling the meteor fields.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Splitter eines alten Sterns mit Zähnen, streift durch die Meteoritenfelder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sharp turn that clips the target mid-flight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine scharfe Wendung, die das Ziel im Flug streift."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shower of warm sparks lifts the whole team's spirit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Schauer warmer Funken hebt die Stimmung des ganzen Teams."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single, absolute command carved in moonlight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein einziger, unumstößlicher Befehl, in Mondlicht gemeißelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slow, commanding push of current.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein langsamer, befehlender Stoß der Strömung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slow, unstoppable punch of liquid rock.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein langsamer, unaufhaltsamer Schlag aus flüssigem Gestein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A slow, warm trickle of restorative sap.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein langsames, warmes Rinnsal aus heilendem Saft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft flutter that eases an ally's pain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein sanftes Flattern, das den Schmerz eines Verbündeten lindert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soundless dive that leaves the target reeling.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein lautloser Sturzflug, der das Ziel taumeln lässt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A spark that never quite burns out, no matter the dark.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Funke, der nie ganz erlischt, egal wie dunkel es ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A spine of interlocking brambles no predator wants to test.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Rücken aus verflochtenen Dornranken, den kein Raubtier testen will."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A star gone dark, still pulling everything nearby toward it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein erloschener Stern, der immer noch alles in der Nähe zu sich zieht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A star that fell from the heavens eons ago, still burning with the light of its old sky.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Stern, der vor Äonen vom Himmel fiel, brennt noch immer mit dem Licht seines alten Himmels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A steadying word that stiffens resolve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein stabilisierendes Wort, das die Entschlossenheit stärkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A strike timed to the one moment no light reaches it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Schlag, getimt auf den einen Moment, in dem kein Licht ihn erreicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sudden burst of light and teeth from the ash cloud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein plötzlicher Ausbruch aus Licht und Zähnen aus der Aschewolke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sudden lash of its coiled body.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein plötzlicher Peitschenhieb seines geringelten Körpers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tangle of thorn and muscle native only to Eternal Bloom.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Gewirr aus Dorn und Muskel, das nur in Eternal Bloom vorkommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A third dreaming of the meadow, wilder and far harder to wake from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein drittes Träumen der Wiese, wilder und weit schwerer zu erwachen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny fire-spirit born from a stray cinder off Ignivar's own flame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein winziger Feuergeist, geboren aus einem verirrten Funken von Ignivars eigener Flamme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A titan of fire that slept beneath the wastes for a thousand years, now awake and furious.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Feuertitan, der tausend Jahre unter der Ödnis schlief, nun wach und wütend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A trickle of a creature that pools into something larger when threatened.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Rinnsal von einem Wesen, das sich bei Bedrohung zu etwas Größerem sammelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A wave of luminous pearls mends the team's wounds.": {
