      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bronze"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build a team from your roster in the Inventory screen. Only deployed Dreamkeepers fight in battle and train at the Training Garden — keep your best team on deck.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stelle im Inventar-Bildschirm ein Team aus deinem Kader zusammen. Nur eingesetzte Dreamkeeper kämpfen in Schlachten und trainieren im Trainingsgarten — halte dein bestes Team bereit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Burrows in and erupts with banked heat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gräbt sich ein und bricht mit gestauter Hitze hervor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calls down a wall of starlight to guard the team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
