      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abgeholt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claimed — Day %lld tomorrow": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abgeholt — Tag %lld morgen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claws curved like the sliver of moon this realm never quite sees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krallen gekrümmt wie die Mondsichel, die dieses Reich nie ganz zu sehen bekommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claws grown from a root that never stopped reaching.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krallen, gewachsen aus einer Wurzel, die nie aufhörte zu wachsen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claws still hot from the lava lake it just crawled out of.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krallen noch heiß vom Lavasee, aus dem es gerade gekrochen ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claws that glow with borrowed light from a galaxy long gone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krallen, die mit geborgtem Licht einer längst vergangenen Galaxie leuchten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claws that leave no mark, only the memory of having been cut.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Krallen, die keine Spur hinterlassen, nur die Erinnerung daran, geschnitten worden zu sein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Claws that pull with the force of a rising tide.": {
