    "Send your team into the Campaign to clear stages, earn gold and EXP, and defeat bosses. Boss victories recruit your next Dreamkeeper automatically.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schicke dein Team in die Kampagne, um Stufen zu schaffen, Gold und EP zu verdienen und Bosse zu besiegen. Bosssiege rekrutieren automatisch deinen nächsten Dreamkeeper."
