        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Apple angemeldet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silent on the forest floor, its spines the only warning it gives.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lautlos auf dem Waldboden, seine Stacheln die einzige Warnung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silver": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silber"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skin as tough and gnarled as the jungle's oldest trees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Haut so zäh und knorrig wie die ältesten Bäume des Dschungels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Überspringen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip Animation": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Animation überspringen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skitters along cracks in the cavern walls where light doesn't quite reach.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Huscht durch Risse in den Höhlenwänden, wo das Licht kaum hinreicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slightly bolder in a fight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwas mutiger im Kampf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slips a sliver of dark across the enemy's eyes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Legt einen Splitter Dunkelheit über die Augen des Gegners."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slips between waves too quick for waking eyes to follow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gleitet zwischen Wellen, zu schnell für wache Augen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slips through the coral forest wrapped in a veil of cold mist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gleitet durch den Korallenwald, gehüllt in einen Schleier kalten Nebels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small and glittering, it scatters into motes when startled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein und glitzernd, zerstiebt bei Schreck zu funkelnden Stäubchen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small and quick, camouflaged among the oversized canopy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein und flink, getarnt im überdimensionalen Blätterdach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small and quick, darting between sunken temple pillars.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein und flink, huscht zwischen versunkenen Tempelsäulen hindurch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small, but drawn from the same light as Elyndor itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein, doch aus demselben Licht wie Elyndor selbst geschöpft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small, quick, and always a little too close to catching fire.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein, schnell und immer knapp davor, selbst Feuer zu fangen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small, quick, and fiercely territorial over its patch of clover.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klein, schnell und fanatisch revierbewusst über sein Kleeflecken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So thickly covered in moss it looks like part of the jungle floor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So dicht mit Moos bedeckt, dass es wie ein Teil des Dschungelbodens wirkt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sort Dreamkeepers": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dreamkeeper sortieren"
          }
        }
      }
